   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) inclusion accrue des femmes, des peuples autochtones et des groupes vuln&#xE9;rables aux projets de normalisation; 2) investissements accrus dans la prestation de services, notamment les services de sant&#xE9; et l&#x2019;&#xE9;ducation, dans les anciens camps du Front de lib&#xE9;ration islamique Moro; 3) r&#xE9;duction des &#xE9;v&#xE9;nements violents impliquant les Forces arm&#xE9;es islamiques de Bangsamoro et le personnel du gouvernement des Philippines; 4) r&#xE9;duction des cas de r&#xE9;cidive chez les combattants des Forces arm&#xE9;es islamiques de Bangsamoro.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) increased inclusion of women, indigenous people and vulnerable groups in normalization projects; (2) increased investments in service delivery, including health and education, in former Moro Islamic Liberation Front camps; (3) reduced violent events involving Bangsamoro Islamic Armed Forces and Government of the Philippines&#x2019; personnel; and (4) reduced incidence of recidivism with former Bangsamoro Islamic Armed Forces combatants.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
